.TH CHMCTL 1
.SH NAME
chmctl \- native Chimera II OS system control gateway
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chmctl
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH COMMANDS
.B status, settings, services, devices, network, logs, reboot, shutdown, help
.SH DESCRIPTION
Routes user-facing system management requests to Aurora Settings and the native Koronos/Kore/Spotnik/Aegis interfaces. Privileged operations are policy-controlled by Koronos and Aegis.
